Subject: d3d9: Include <algorithm> in d3d9_mem.cpp.

The file calls std::max and std::remove_if but reached them through a
transitive include that current libc++ no longer pulls in, so the build fails.
Include <algorithm> directly.

Based on d9vk 905027e.

diff --git a/src/d3d9/d3d9_mem.cpp b/src/d3d9/d3d9_mem.cpp
index ec256246..5662a213 100644
--- a/src/d3d9/d3d9_mem.cpp
+++ b/src/d3d9/d3d9_mem.cpp
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 #include "../util/log/log.h"
 #include "../util/util_likely.h"
 #include <utility>
+#include <algorithm>
 
 #ifdef D3D9_ALLOW_UNMAPPING
 #include <sysinfoapi.h>
